<!--	
	Not Empty:
		wp_g17_clip_grab > grab a new mag 
		wp_foley_generic_clip_grab > grab the old mag 
		wp_usp_clip_out > drop old mag 
		wp_clip_generic_pist_right > twist the gun to exchange the mags 
		wp_g17_clip_in_contact > new mag is about to be slid into the pistol (contacts)
		wp_usp_clip_slide_in > slide the new mag in
		wp_foley_generic_lever_grab > resettle gun
		
	Empty:
		wp_foley_generic_clip_grab > grab a new mag 
		wp_g17_clip_grab > beginning to drop old mag and prepare to insert new mag
		wp_usp_clip_out > drop old mag 
		wp_clip_generic_pist_right > prepare to insert new mag 
		wp_g17_clip_in_contact > new mag is about to be slid into the pistol (contacts)
		wp_usp_clip_slide_in > slide the new mag in
		wp_foley_generic_lever_grab > grab the slide
		wp_foley_generic_lever_pull > pull back the slide
		wp_foley_generic_lever_release > release the slide
		wp_foley_generic_lever_grab > resettle gun after pulling back slide
		
	   -->		
	
